               <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-blue-600 mr-2"></i> <strong>Borough:</strong> Manhattan</li>
               [cite_start]<li><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-blue-600 mr-2"></i> <strong>Primary Pain Point:</strong> Private placement and high-stakes legal pressure. [cite: 1]</li>
            </ul>
         </div>
      </section>

